    "description": "Get all staff members of the organization (no pagination). PRIMARY ENDPOINT FOR LOOKING UP A STAFF MEMBER BY NAME OR FILTERING BY STAFF TYPE — pass the name in the `search` query param to filter at the backend (faster than fetching all + matching locally). Supports optional name search and optional staffType filter. Omit staffType to return all staff.",
